#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/zerto.rst:40
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Définir Veeam comme cible de sauvegarde Cloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/zerto.rst:41
msgid ""
"The integration is accessible to all Tenants (option available to "
"|mastertenant| users only)"
